      "description": "Memory usage as reported by the Proxmox exporter for Proxmox nodes and QEMU VMs.\n\nThis value may include memory used by Linux cache/buffers inside VMs, so high usage here does not always mean real memory pressure. For Linux VMs, use node_exporter MemAvailable-based alerts for accurate low-memory detection.",
